{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 83604, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 58398, "uid": 42813, "type": 4, "title": "8.12火raid预攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1627024833, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1629375052, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 84, "status": 1, "summary": "8.16更新：这个帖子里这种练度也能斩车，非常厉害，配置我就不贴了可以自己去看一下。链接同样是比较萌新的双刀队斩车实例链接与六红伊芙斩车实例链接实战之后的更新：因为策划把充能（习惯称为拉条或者瞬补）给", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829267906_92341226.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829263094_12122981.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025128994_23981098.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 20, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 34314, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 83604, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><div class=\"div-img\">8.16更新：</div><div class=\"div-img\">这个帖子里这种练度也能斩车，非常厉害，配置我就不贴了可以自己去看一下。<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/85655.html\" target=\"_blank\">链接</a></div><div class=\"div-img\">同样是比较萌新的双刀队斩车实例<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/85641.html\" target=\"_blank\">链接</a>与六红伊芙斩车实例<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/85697.html\" target=\"_blank\">链接</a></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">实战之后的更新：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;因为策划把充能（习惯称为拉条或者瞬补）给ban了，现在对阵容和技能预约需要做出一些调整。<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">经过多次尝试后我使用的阵容</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829263094_12122981.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829263094_12122981.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829267906_92341226.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829267906_92341226.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;目前的情况是只要能进第三个ft就能稳定斩车，</span>然后有几个可能的设置上的疑问：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;①为什么选青钢影当leader，而不是对策/雷欧？因为运气不好被boss大招眩晕或者多吃几个减DS量表，就进不了3ft了，就很有可能斩不了车，因此选择了青钢影的leader确保DS能获取的更快。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;②雷欧为什么放S-T,T的充能不是无效吗？理由和第一条是一样的，S-T的设置攒DS要比S更快，而且雷欧我设置为二攻，能吃到加速buff，即使放T大部分时间内buff也不会断。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;③那为什么木莫娜不设置成S-T呢？我把木莫娜设置成了三攻，会吃boss的重置skill量表和CT+4s，而本身是全程吃不到任何加速buff的，因此为了不断buff单放S。另外六红鲁邦的话S-T或者S-T-T都行，没有六红建议S-T。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;④DS设置成雷欧-鲁邦？是的，相较类似对策-雷欧-鲁邦的DS设置，这样设置在理论上输出更高，不过因为我的队伍伤害多多少少有点溢出，不是很能测出两种设置之间的差距，各位可以自行尝试。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">备注：手操斩车不用考虑能不能进第三个FT，基本是必进的，leader可以给到对策/雷欧。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;大概情况就是这样，我没有点伊芙和水女警，因此SS刀的组队也很难去测试，可以看看评论或者其它帖子。</span>我这里还是推荐原阵容3，鲜花不是不能上，只是作用比原来要小得多。另外也可以不上对策，参考原阵容4。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">以下内容基本不再更新</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本攻略是在日服版本的基础上写的，实装时可能略有出入，组队主要针对全自动（full auto）。本攻略将分为boss介绍，角色推荐，点火相关，组队推荐四大部分。此次boss的技能组比较恐怖，请做好心理准备。当文中内容与你的理解出现偏差，以你自身为准。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">boss介绍</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025093375_62059359.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025093375_62059359.jpg\" style=\"width: 530px; height: 360px;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\">技能翻译：</div><div class=\"div-img\">TS：对2名敌人（优先最高HP）造成伤害，有100%的概率造成时间篡改，持续14s&amp;2名减益中的敌人造成流血，持续12s&amp;1名敌人（优先最低HP）Drive量表-100</div><div class=\"div-img\">SS：对3名敌人（优先最高HP）造成伤害，赋予魅惑，持续16s&amp;100%的概率对3名敌人（优先最高攻击力）造成重置Skill量表，赋予Slide Skill冷却时间+4s</div><div class=\"div-img\">DS：对全体敌人造成伤害，造成流血，持续18s&amp;有100%的概率对2名敌人（优先最高攻击力）造成晕眩，持续18s</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">难点分析：减益太多，必须至少保证刀的减益无效buff不能断，断了就中魅惑，中魅惑=寄，没有什么其它好办法。这里统计一下各个关键debuff的优先目标，①HP最高：两体时间篡改，三体魅惑②攻击力最高：三体重置Skill量表，三体SS冷却+4s，两体晕眩。本期对于攻击力顺序的调整要稍微重视，嫌麻烦不调也不是不行。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">备注：最高HP=剩余血量百分比最高，最高攻击力需要考虑buff提升的攻击力</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">关于raid中boss血量的题外话</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<div data-col=\"12\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"62282\" data-insertcount=\"0\" data-select=\"[]\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 744px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 62px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                