s=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S15血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">900W（劳菲）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">900W（劳菲）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S14血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">750W（情人节）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">850W（罗密欧）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S13血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">800W（该隐）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">750W（该隐）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S12血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">800W（罗密欧）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">750W（情人节）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S11血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">700（卢茵）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">700W（卢茵）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">S10血量</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">650W（比利）</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">700W（暗妲比）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42.4px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">......</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">......</div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">......</div></td></tr></tbody>\n                                    </table>\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;只希望国际服能长期保持1100W血量（或者降到1000W？），再涨血量都要赶超日服了。</div></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">角色推荐</span></span></p></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">日服对策角色技能</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025128994_23981098.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025128994_23981098.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div></div><div>技能翻译（+6）：</div><div>TS：造成伤害，有80.1%的概率为攻击力最高的2名盟友解除魅惑</div><div>SS：对随机2名敌人造成伤害，2名水属性盟友（攻击力最高）赋予减益无效（14秒后或是受到一次减益后无效）&amp;2名盟友（最低HP）最大HP+2360，持续16s&amp;副本中，2名水属性盟友（攻击力最高）赋予双刃剑110.2%（攻击力上升/防御力下降）</div><div>DS：对随机3名敌人造成伤害，随机5名盟友赋予减益无效（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">14秒后或是受到一次减益后无效）</span></div><div>LS：水属性盟友的攻击力+18%（副本中追加+15%）</div></div>\n                               </div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">本攻略中刀卡仅考虑水属性。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">刀卡推荐：<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/71695.html\" target=\"_blank\">青钢影</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20445.html\" target=\"_blank\">伊芙</a>（六红）、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/50291.html\" target=\"_blank\">菩萨</a>（六红）、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20241.html\" target=\"_blank\">老头</a>、*<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/25577.html\" target=\"_blank\">水护士</a></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">输出能力梯队(仅胎五，条件相同情况下)</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T0：六红青钢影</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T1：六红伊芙、菩萨</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T2：六红老头</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T3：其它六红及高红水刀</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T4：两红青钢影</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T5：两红老头、其它四红左右水刀</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T6：不点火青钢影</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T7：不点火老头</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">T8：其它不点火水刀</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">备注：水护士主要是有一个狂暴，但是强不强不好说，这里先当成一般水刀，等开发。</div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">辅助推荐：</div><div class=\"div-img\">T0：无</div><div class=\"div-img\">T1：对策、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/62507.html\" target=\"_blank\">雷欧</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/61198.html\" target=\"_blank\">水狙</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/77369.html\" target=\"_blank\">鲁邦</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20741.html\" target=\"_blank\">木莫娜</a>、*点火<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20568.html\" target=\"_blank\">初音</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/60169.html\" target=\"_blank\">火人鱼</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/52603.html\" target=\"_blank\">鲜花</a></div><div class=\"div-img\">T2：<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/69333.html\" target=\"_blank\">白猫</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20750.html\" target=\"_blank\">海王星</a>、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20736.html\" target=\"_blank\">水妲比</a>、点火<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20656.html\" target=\"_blank\">牡丹</a>、点火<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20571.html\" target=\"_blank\">米粒</a></div><div class=\"div-img\">T3：<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/29503.html\" target=\"_blank\">花奶</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">、<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20441.html\" target=\"_blank\">教皇</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">等其他偏向生存的角色</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">备注：初音可视为木莫娜上位，有的人太少，后面不会主要考虑。点火牡丹、米粒皆可视为水狙下位。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">点火相关</span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"div-img\">对策卡不同点火阶段变化（日版）如下：</div><div class=\"div-img\">两红：LS中副本追加攻击力+15%→20%</div><div class=\"div-img\">三红：TS中解除魅惑的概率80.1%→85.1%</div><div class=\"div-img\">四红：SS中赋予双刃剑的目标从2名变为3名，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">双刃剑110.2%→120.2%</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">五红：DS中<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">14秒后或是受到一次减益后无效→<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">14秒后或是受到两次减益后无效</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">六红：TS中效果变更，解除魅惑→魅惑无效，持续8s</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">点火推荐：一言难尽，这里先贴一个<a href=\"https://gamewith.jp/destiny-child/article/show/239093\" target=\"_blank\">资料来源</a>（需要魔法），两红效果还行。三红和六红本身效果中规中矩，然而有一个问题：boss上魅惑的目标是三体最高血，对策解魅惑/魅惑无效的对象是两体最高攻，如果我不能保证两体最高攻的天子同时也是队伍中最高血，我这个buff上了等于没上，而且又是概率上buff，大部分人最后用的都是+0，62.7%的概率。别说辅助，就连刀也不能稳定保证不吃魅惑，这对策的TS非常鸡肋。四红堪称逆天，SS三个效果：减益无效、+最大HP、双刃剑，结果强化只强化一个双刃剑，这是让我多上几把刀还是我要靠辅助打伤害？五红，算是最正常和实用的一个强化了。那么总体来说，我都不知道怎么推荐点火，大概冲榜点满，不冲就不点。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/68263.html\" target=\"_blank\">刀卡点火石推荐看这里</a></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">组队推荐</span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">阵容初步确认</span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在我预想中，这次阵容将是百花齐放，因为有许多高质量的水属性辅助。首先还是单刀，考虑到减益过多，对策/鲜花至少上一个。这里先看上对策的情况（推荐）：①如果偏向伤害buff，则<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">刀+对策+雷欧/水狙/鲁邦/木莫娜四选三</span>，但是雷欧/鲁邦至少上一个，因为需要强力DS进FT②火人鱼与青钢影、boss的相性都非常好，我非常推荐上，此时<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">刀+对策+火人鱼+<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雷欧/水狙/鲁邦/木莫娜四选二</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">，同样雷欧/鲁邦至少上一个。然后是不上对策的情况，和上对策的思路相近，</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">刀+鲜花+水妲比（海王星）/<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雷欧/水狙/鲁邦/木莫娜五选三</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，或者<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">刀+鲜花+火人鱼+<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">水妲比（海王星）/</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雷欧/水狙/鲁邦/木莫娜五选二</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">。当然对策和鲜花都上也是可以的，因为鲜花的兼容性太好了，所以就在情况①中把鲜花也加入备选，即<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;\">刀+对策+</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">鲜花/<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雷欧/水狙/鲁邦/木莫娜五选三。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;因为可用的阵容实在太多了，接下来在具体配置中并不会出现所有的排列组合，我先进行筛选，找出几个比较均衡的阵容，不保证每个人都能找到自己最适合的解，而是找出来的解能适用于大部分人。</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">具体配置</span></p></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">含初音的组队</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">阵容0.1：刀+对策+初音+雷欧+鲁邦</span><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">阵容0.2：青钢影+对策+初音+雷欧+火人鱼</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">不予深入</span></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">阵容1（优先考虑）：青钢影+对策+火人鱼+雷欧+木莫娜</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">特点：均衡阵容，生存能力、减益应对能力、输出能力都很高，青钢影建议至少两红，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">木莫娜</span>可换鲜花/水狙</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">技能预约：青钢影T；对策S；火人鱼T；雷欧S-T 或者 S-T-T；木莫娜S 或者 S-T</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">DS顺序：三号位固定雷欧，一二号位推荐对策、青钢影、鲜花，比如：青钢影-对策-雷欧</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">阵容2：青钢影+对策+火人鱼+白猫+雷欧</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">特点：更注重充能，青钢影至少两红，即使队伍整体加值低也可打出高伤害<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">技能预约：青钢影T；对策S；火人鱼T；白猫T；雷欧S-T 或者 S-T-T</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">DS顺序：三号位固定雷欧，一二号位推荐对策、青钢影、火人鱼，比如：火人鱼-对策-雷欧</div></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">阵容3（优先考虑）：刀<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">+对策</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">+雷欧</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">+鲁邦+木莫娜</span></span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">特点：没有青钢影的情况下较优的选择，</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">可用</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">鲜花替换木莫娜/鲁邦，刀也可以用青钢影</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">技能预约：对策S；雷欧S-T 或者 S-T-T；鲁邦S-T 或者 S-T-T；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">木莫娜S 或者 S-T</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">DS顺序：方案①为双循环：雷欧-鲁邦；方案②为三循环，一二号位推荐鲜花、对策，比如：对策-雷欧-鲁邦</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">阵容4：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">刀+鲜花</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">+水妲比/海王星+雷欧+木莫娜</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">特点：适合不抽对策的玩家，</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">可用鲁邦替换水妲比/雷欧/木莫娜</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">技能预约：鲜花T；水妲比/海王星S；雷欧S-T 或者 S-T-T；</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">木莫娜S 或者 S-T</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">DS顺序：参考阵容3，可以是三循环，一二号位推荐鲜花、水妲比，如：鲜花-水妲比-雷欧；也可以上鲁邦，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">雷欧-鲁邦</span></span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;装备、附魔、温泉等基础比较差的青钢影优先阵容2，基础比较好的青钢影阵容123皆可，伊芙、菩萨优先选择阵容3。火人鱼一般绑定青钢影使用。阵容4并不推荐，能抽对策的还是尽量抽，即使+0也很有用。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">装备、附魔及魂卡选择</span></p></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">刀卡堆攻击，暴击随缘堆。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">奶堆血攻，其它辅助主堆血，次堆防。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">刀的魂卡：加值近似下可按如下顺序选择</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">对TS刀是（新魂卡＞）<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/71698.html\" target=\"_blank\">夏娃之怒</a>＞第二次死亡=其它高攻白板魂卡</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">对SS刀是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">（新魂卡＞）夏娃之怒</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">＞<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/62509.html\" target=\"_blank\">第二次死亡</a>=<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/25599.html\" target=\"_blank\">宁静时刻</a>=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">其它高攻白板魂卡（宁静时刻请绑定暴击辅助）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">辅助的魂卡：<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/21011.html\" target=\"_blank\">南瓜卡</a>＞其它</div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\">对于决定的攻击力最高的三名天子，最好有S级的减益回避率附魔，不过本身比较稀有，也不用强求。</div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">部<span style=\"\">分细节</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\">1.leader选择：有青钢影选青钢影，没有可以选雷欧或者对策</div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\">2.技能预约：</div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">雷欧<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">S-T 或者 S-T-T？六红S-T-T，其它S-T</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">鲁邦<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">S-T 或者 S-T-T？六红S-T-T，其它S-T</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">木莫娜S 或者 S-T？无血线压力S，有就S-T</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">队内有对策时，鲜花一般打T-S或者S，如果在上对策的情况下刀还是经常身上挂着减益，可以考虑只打T。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">对策一般只打S，高加的情况下可以打S-T。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">3.攻击力调整：在队伍中有对策时，一攻是刀不用说，二攻通常给到水属性辅助，主要是蹭对策SS的减益无效。然后三攻，先看之前统计的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">①HP最高：两体时间篡改，三体魅惑②攻击力最高：三体重置Skill量表，三体SS冷却+4s，两体晕眩</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">，那么因为三攻是吃不到减益无效的，我们的思路就是希望debuff造成的影响最小。这里本来我写了很多，想了想过于纸上谈兵就删了，等一下实战看看情况再说。关于针对最高HP的debuff稍微谈一下，因为boss的TS、SS伤害都是优先最高HP，DS又是全队伤害，几乎不会出现某些队员的血量百分比始终高于其它人的情况，除非是有特殊的附魔，比如吸血、受到伤害回血这些，或者本身血量、防御特别高，boss打上去就掉一点点血。但是大部分玩家都不是这样的，所以针对HP最高的debuff很像是随机上的，理论上说角色的面板血量、防御越高，吃到的频率就越高。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829267906_92341226.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628829263094_12122981.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627025128994_23981098.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 42813, "username": "不再年轻了", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 26, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 18, "read_num": 378323, "like_num": 292}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "",